This native DSH adapter is maintained by the flyingcoding/dsh-magic-context fork.

Audited source reuse from cortexkit/magic-context (MIT), baseline
6f718ff019bf327a0b291a8510dfb42f91b65921:

- packages/plugin/src/shared/sqlite.ts -> src/sqlite.ts: Node DatabaseSync,
  savepoint-aware transactions, readonly option compatibility, and argument binding.
  Bun/Electron selection, global connection accounting, privileged writers, and
  injected slow-write reporting are omitted because the DSH store does not use them.
- packages/plugin/src/features/magic-context/memory/normalize-hash.ts:
  src/normalize.ts retains whitespace and case normalization for keyword search.
  The unused MD5 helper is omitted; DSH write deduplication preserves case.
- packages/plugin/src/features/magic-context/memory/types.ts -> src/types.ts:
  only the existing seven-category vocabulary; no upstream store interfaces.
- packages/plugin/scripts/smoke-node-sqlite.ts,
  packages/plugin/src/shared/sqlite-bind-style.test.ts,
  packages/plugin/src/shared/sqlite-import-fence.test.ts, and
  packages/plugin/src/features/magic-context/memory/normalize-hash.test.ts:
  retained Node behavior and source guards are covered by tests/sqlite.test.ts,
  tests/source-boundaries.test.ts, and tests/normalize.test.ts. Guards scan DSH only.

The runtime bundle contains the adapted, versioned local leaves. No compiled community port,
upstream compaction engine, embedding model, UI runtime, or auxiliary agent is
used by the native Host memory path. DSH Client code is a separate browser artifact.

Upstream MIT notices are retained in LICENSE. The upstream OpenCode and Pi
package identities remain part of the full source mirror on origin_main; the
DSH-only branch neither publishes nor maintains those packages.
